935
01:11:54,653 --> 01:11:56,993
He said, “Bring them here to me.”

936
01:11:58,053 --> 01:12:03,993
He commanded the multitudes to sit down on
the grass; and he took the five loaves and

937
01:12:04,033 --> 01:12:10,513
