955
01:13:26,973 --> 01:13:27,993
He said, “Come!”

956
01:13:28,413 --> 01:13:33,153
Peter stepped down from the boat and
walked on the waters to come to Jesus.

957
01:13:33,793 --> 01:13:39,753
But when he saw that the wind was strong,
he was afraid, and beginning to sink, he cried

958
01:13:39,793 --> 01:13:42,993
out, saying, “Lord, save me!”

959
01:13:44,633 --> 01:13:50,353
Immediately Jesus stretched out his hand,
took hold of him, and said to him, “You of

960
01:13:50,393 --> 01:13:52,533
