1013
01:17:53,888 --> 01:17:54,788
table.”

1014
01:17:55,048 --> 01:17:59,368
Then Jesus answered her, “Woman, great is
your faith!

1015
01:17:59,908 --> 01:18:02,188
Be it done to you even as you desire.”

1016
01:18:03,288 --> 01:18:05,668
