1029
01:19:09,999 --> 01:19:13,379
They said, “Seven, and a few small fish.”

1030
01:19:14,139 --> 01:19:20,199
He commanded the multitude to sit down on
the ground; and he took the seven loaves and

1031
01:19:20,239 --> 01:19:21,119
the fish.

1032
01:19:21,159 --> 01:19:27,559
