didn’t speak to you concerning bread?

1058
01:21:19,459 --> 01:21:23,039
But beware of the yeast of the Pharisees
and Sadducees.”

1059
01:21:23,197 --> 01:21:29,077
Then they understood that he didn’t tell them
to beware of the yeast of bread, but of

1060
01:21:29,117 --> 01:21:31,977
the teaching of the Pharisees and
Sadducees.

1061
01:21:32,777 --> 01:21:39,917
Now when Jesus came into the parts
of Caesarea Philippi, he asked his disciples, saying,

1062
01:21:40,737 --> 01:21:43,317
“Who do men say that I, the Son of Man,
am?”

1063
01:21:43,357 --> 01:21:50,497
They said, “Some say John the Baptiser,
some, Elijah, and others, Jeremiah

1064
01:21:50,537 --> 01:21:52,257
or one of the prophets.”

1065
01:21:53,437 --> 01:21:56,817
He said to them, “But who do you say that
I am?”

1066
01:21:57,777 --> 01:22:02,537
Simon Peter answered, “You are the Christ,
the Son of the living God.”

1067
01:22:03,217 --> 01:22:09,637
Jesus answered him, “Blessed are you, Simon Bar
