2212
02:53:23,634 --> 02:53:28,955
Therefore, don’t be foolish, but
understand what the will of the Lord is.

2213
02:53:29,414 --> 02:53:35,974
Don’t be drunken with wine, in which is
dissipation, but be filled with the Spirit, speaking

2214
02:53:36,015 --> 02:53:42,494
