2236
02:55:34,552 --> 02:55:37,092
Ephesians, chapter six.

2237
02:55:37,132 --> 02:55:40,992
Children, obey your parents in the Lord,
for this is right.

2238
02:55:41,032 --> 02:55:47,132
“Honour your father and mother,” which is
the first commandment with a promise: “that

2239
02:55:47,172 --> 02:55:50,852
