2250
02:56:48,515 --> 02:56:52,835
Finally, be strong in the Lord and in the
strength of his might.

2251
02:56:53,295 --> 02:56:59,015
Put on the whole armour of God, that you
may be able to stand against the wiles of the

2252
02:56:59,055 --> 02:56:59,755
devil.

2253
02:56:59,795 --> 02:57:05,655
For our wrestling is not against flesh
and blood, but against the principalities, against

2254
02:57:05,695 --> 02:57:11,975
the powers, against the world’s rulers of the
darkness of this age, and against the spiritual

2255
02:57:12,015 --> 02:57:14,755
forces of wickedness in the heavenly
places.

2256
02:57:15,315 --> 02:57:21,175
Therefore put on the whole armour of God, that
you may be able to withstand in the evil

2257
02:57:21,215 --> 02:57:24,215
day, and having done all, to stand.

2258
02:57:25,095 --> 02:57:31,555
Stand therefore, having the utility belt of
