2276
02:58:53,403 --> 02:58:55,563
Philippians, chapter one.

2277
02:58:55,603 --> 02:59:02,323
Paul and Timothy, servants of Jesus
Christ, to all the saints in Christ Jesus

2278
02:59:02,363 --> 02:59:08,883
