2279
02:59:08,923 --> 02:59:12,243
from God our Father and the Lord Jesus
Christ.

2280
02:59:13,003 --> 02:59:19,483
I thank my God whenever I remember you,
always in every request of mine on behalf of

2281
02:59:19,523 --> 02:59:26,023
you all, making my requests with joy,
for your partnership in furtherance of the Good

2282
02:59:26,063 --> 02:59:32,543
News from the first day until now; being
confident of this very thing, that

2283
02:59:32,583 --> 02:59:38,003
