2288
03:00:01,863 --> 03:00:08,523
This I pray, that your love may abound
yet more and more in knowledge and all discernment,

2289
03:00:08,923 --> 03:00:14,443
so that you may approve the things that
are excellent, that you may be sincere and without

2290
03:00:14,483 --> 03:00:20,123
