with the fruits of righteousness which are

2291
03:00:20,163 --> 03:00:24,063
through Jesus Christ, to the glory and
praise of God.

2292
03:00:25,123 --> 03:00:30,483
Now I desire to have you know, brothers,
that the things which happened to me have turned

2293
03:00:30,523 --> 03:00:36,383
