2297
03:00:51,183 --> 03:00:57,303
Some indeed preach Christ even out of envy
and strife, and some also out of good will.

2298
03:00:58,363 --> 03:01:04,483
The former insincerely preach Christ from
selfish ambition, thinking that they add affliction

2299
03:01:04,523 --> 03:01:10,663
