your boasting may abound in Christ Jesus in

2316
03:02:27,008 --> 03:02:29,568
me through my presence with you again.

2317
03:02:30,208 --> 03:02:36,108
Only let your way of life be worthy of
the Good News of Christ, that whether I come and

2318
03:02:36,148 --> 03:02:42,808
