2331
03:03:48,269 --> 03:03:50,729
but each of you also to the things of
others.

2332
03:03:50,769 --> 03:03:57,449
Have this in your mind, which was also in
Christ Jesus, who, existing in the form

2333
03:03:57,489 --> 03:04:03,749
of God, didn’t consider equality with God
a thing to be grasped, but emptied himself,

2334
03:04:04,449 --> 03:04:08,449
taking the form of a servant, being made
