I myself might have confidence even in the

2376
03:07:47,928 --> 03:07:48,582
flesh.

2377
03:07:48,622 --> 03:07:55,322
If any other man thinks that he has
confidence in the flesh, I yet more: circumcised

2378
03:07:55,362 --> 03:08:02,282
the eighth day, of the stock of Israel,
of the tribe of Benjamin, a Hebrew of Hebrews;

2379
03:08:02,802 --> 03:08:09,582
concerning the law, a Pharisee; concerning
zeal, persecuting the assembly; concerning

2380
03:08:09,622 --> 03:08:13,222
the righteousness which is in the law,
found blameless.

2381
03:08:14,162 --> 03:08:19,742
However, I consider those things that were
gain to me as a loss for Christ.

2382
03:08:20,722 --> 03:08:27,002
Yes most certainly, and I count all things to
be a loss for the excellency of the knowledge

2383
03:08:27,042 --> 03:08:32,982
