forward to the things which are before, I

2393
03:09:27,362 --> 03:09:32,302
press on towards the goal for the prize of
the high calling of God in Christ Jesus.

2394
03:09:32,982 --> 03:09:36,882
Let us therefore, as many as are perfect,
think this way.

2395
03:09:37,542 --> 03:09:42,642
If in anything you think otherwise, God
will also reveal that to you.

2396
03:09:43,462 --> 03:09:49,442
Nevertheless, to the extent that we have
already attained, let’s walk by the same rule.

2397
03:09:50,162 --> 03:09:51,642
Let’s be of the same mind.

2398
03:09:52,562 --> 03:09:59,162
Brothers, be imitators together of me, and
note those who walk this way, even as

2399
03:09:59,202 --> 03:10:00,742
you have us for an example.

2400
03:10:01,136 --> 03:10:07,656
For many walk, of whom I told you often,
and now tell you even weeping, as the

2401
03:10:07,696 --> 03:10:14,716
enemies of the cross of Christ, whose end
is destruction, whose god is the belly, and

2402
03:10:14,756 --> 03:10:19,096
whose glory is in their shame, who think
about earthly things.

2403
03:10:19,796 --> 03:10:30,896
For our citizenship is in heaven, from
where we also wait for

2404
03:10:30,936 --> 03:10:31,276
a Saviour, the Lord Jesus Christ, who will
change the body of our humiliation to be conformed

2405
03:10:31,316 --> 03:10:37,416
to the body of his glory, according to the
working by which he is able even to subject

2406
03:10:37,456 --> 03:10:38,996
all things to himself.

2407
03:10:39,556 --> 03:10:41,896
Philippians, chapter four.

2408
03:10:41,936 --> 03:10:48,496
Therefore, my brothers, beloved and longed
for, my joy and crown, stand firm in

2409
03:10:48,536 --> 03:10:50,676
the Lord in this way, my beloved.

2410
03:10:51,676 --> 03:10:57,476
I exhort Euodia, and I exhort Syntyche, to
think the same way in the Lord.

2411
03:10:58,056 --> 03:11:04,596
Yes, I beg you also, true partner, help
these women, for they laboured

2412
03:11:04,636 --> 03:11:10,676
