2413
03:11:10,716 --> 03:11:12,316
names are in the book of life.

2414
03:11:13,356 --> 03:11:14,996
Rejoice in the Lord always!

2415
03:11:15,596 --> 03:11:17,556
Again I will say, “Rejoice!”

2416
03:11:18,256 --> 03:11:21,216
Let your gentleness be known to all men.

2417
03:11:21,736 --> 03:11:22,896
The Lord is at hand.

2418
03:11:23,816 --> 03:11:30,616
In nothing be anxious, but in everything,
by prayer and petition with thanksgiving, let

2419
03:11:30,656 --> 03:11:33,016
your requests be made known to God.

2420
03:11:33,876 --> 03:11:39,736
And the peace of God, which surpasses
all understanding, will guard your hearts and your

2421
03:11:39,776 --> 03:11:41,176
thoughts in Christ Jesus.

2422
03:11:41,956 --> 03:11:48,516
Finally, brothers, whatever things are
true, whatever things are honourable, whatever

2423
03:11:48,556 --> 03:11:55,096
things are just, whatever things are pure,
whatever things are lovely, whatever

2424
03:11:55,136 --> 03:12:01,536
things are of good report: if there is any
virtue and if there is anything worthy of

2425
03:12:01,576 --> 03:12:04,056
