again to my need.

2441
03:13:13,033 --> 03:13:18,413
Not that I seek for the gift, but I
seek for the fruit that increases to your account.

2442
03:13:19,413 --> 03:13:21,313
But I have all things and abound.

2443
03:13:22,273 --> 03:13:29,113
I am filled, having received from Epaphroditus
the things that came from you, a

2444
03:13:29,153 --> 03:13:34,513
