and well-pleasing sacrifice to God.

2445
03:13:35,153 --> 03:13:41,053
My God will supply every need of yours
according to his riches in glory in Christ Jesus.

2446
03:13:41,873 --> 03:13:46,253
Now to our God and Father be the glory
forever and ever!

2447
03:13:46,933 --> 03:13:47,833
Amen.

2448
03:13:48,413 --> 03:13:50,553
Greet every saint in Christ Jesus.

2449
03:13:51,413 --> 03:13:53,413
The brothers who are with me greet you.

2450
03:13:53,913 --> 03:13:58,493
All the saints greet you, especially those
who are of Caesar’s household.

2451
03:13:59,673 --> 03:14:02,853
The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with
you all.

2452
03:14:03,373 --> 03:14:04,273
Amen.

2453
03:14:04,853 --> 03:14:06,813
Daniel, chapter one.

2454
03:14:06,853 --> 03:14:12,693
In the third year of the reign of
Jehoiakim king of Judah, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon

2455
03:14:12,733 --> 03:14:15,413
