offspring and of the nobles: youths in

2461
03:14:44,722 --> 03:14:51,462
whom was no defect, but well-favoured,
skilful in all wisdom, endowed with knowledge,

2462
03:14:52,102 --> 03:14:58,002
understanding science, and who had the ability
to stand in the king’s palace; and that

2463
03:14:58,042 --> 03:15:01,702
he should teach them the learning and the
language of the Chaldeans.

2464
03:15:02,342 --> 03:15:07,882
The king appointed for them a daily portion
of the king’s delicacies and of the wine

2465
03:15:07,922 --> 03:15:14,022
which he drank, and that they should be
nourished three years, that at its end they should

2466
03:15:14,062 --> 03:15:15,322
stand before the king.

2467
03:15:15,722 --> 03:15:22,202
Now amongst these of the children of Judah
were Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and

2468
03:15:22,242 --> 03:15:22,802
Azariah.

2469
03:15:22,842 --> 03:15:29,882
