king.”

2480
03:16:16,922 --> 03:16:21,982
Then Daniel said to the steward whom the
prince of the eunuchs had appointed over Daniel,

2481
03:16:22,702 --> 03:16:29,302
Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah: “Test your
servants, I beg you, ten days;

2482
03:16:29,882 --> 03:16:33,482
and let them give us vegetables to eat and
