2500
03:17:54,537 --> 03:17:57,897
Daniel continued even to the first year of
King Cyrus.

2501
03:17:58,977 --> 03:18:01,197
Daniel, chapter two.

2502
03:18:01,237 --> 03:18:07,037
In the second year of the
reign of Nebuchadnezzar, Nebuchadnezzar dreamt dreams; and

2503
03:18:07,077 --> 03:18:10,317
